id: pm-gh1562
title: "GH-1562: expose calendar matching totals and bounded continuation"
description: "Reported on2026.10.23: runCalendar limit2 returns two of three reminders while exposing only post-limit summaries and filters.limit, with no total, omission receipt, has_more or bounded continuation. Investigate core SDK completeness metadata and recoverable bounded reads, without claiming stored data loss."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"gh:1562",sdk
created_at: "2026-10-23T15:20:50.258Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T19:19:38.193Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T19:19:37.129Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-24T19:19:37.129Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: A limited calendar result discloses matching versus returned scope and omissions; callers can recover omitted rows through bounded continuation or a concrete bounded recovery with stated consistency limits; public CalendarResult types describe the completeness fields; sandboxed reminder and deadline controls cover exact-full and truncated windows without stored data loss.
parent: pm-qh3p
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Calendar SDK exposes matching, returned and remaining totals with fixed-clock continuation; CLI/package/MCP and shell completion agree, summaries identify returned-row scope, and both empty/count-only and populated Markdown retain recurrence warnings."
expected_result: "Retrieve bounded calendar pages consistently and disclose completeness, summary scope and recurrence caps through every supported transport."
actual_result: Linked40calendar/transport plus107completion tests pass with real capped count-only/empty controls and a failing-before missing-warning control; public Node-to-Bun cursor and real shells pass. Prior complete11208-test runtime coverage is exact100percent; current local performance refusals remain separately documented with unchanged budgets and final hosted static/coverage required.
affected_version: 2026.10.23
